## Feature 2: Recurring Monthly Donation — F2-02

### Business Value
- **Revenue predictability**: Monthly recurring generates sustained income
- **Donor retention**: Subscription model increases lifetime value
- **Growth metric**: Recurring donors are key fundraising KPI

### Frontend Impact
| Component | Change | Priority |
|---|---|---|
| `SubscriptionSetupView.swift` | New view — monthly donation setup | P0 |
| `SubscriptionManageView.swift` | New view — view/cancel subscriptions | P0 |
| `CampaignDetailView.swift` | Modified — add "Monthly" donation option | P0 |

### Backend Impact
| Component | Change | Priority |
|---|---|---|
| `create-subscription` Edge Function | New — Razorpay subscription creation | P0 |
| `cancel-subscription` Edge Function | New — subscription cancellation | P0 |
| `subscription-webhook` Edge Function | New — recurring payment event handler | P0 |
| `SubscriptionService.swift` | New — subscription management | P0 |

### Database Impact
| Table | Change |
|---|---|
| `subscriptions` | New table — subscription_id, user_id, campaign_id, status, amount, frequency |
| `payment_logs` | Extended — log recurring payment events |
| `donations` | Add column: `subscription_id` (FK → subscriptions) |

