## Cross-Feature Dependencies

```
F2-06 (Campaign Creation) ──────► F2-08 (Verification) ──────► F2-07 (Marketplace)
         │                                                            │
         ▼                                                            ▼
F2-09 (Dashboard) ◄──────────────────────────────────── Donations flow in
         │
         ▼
F2-05 (AI Report)

F2-07 (Marketplace) ──► Donation ──► F2-01 (Tax Receipt)
                                ──► F2-03 (Progress Bar update)
                                ──► F2-04 (Donor Wall update)
                                ──► F2-02 (Recurring if monthly)
```

### Implementation Order (Dependencies Resolved)
1. **Phase 1**: Database + Architecture (foundation for all features)
2. **Phase 2**: F2-06 (Campaign Creation) → F2-08 (Verification) — creator ecosystem
3. **Phase 3**: F2-07 (Marketplace) → F2-03 (Progress Bar) → F2-04 (Donor Wall) — discovery
4. **Phase 4**: Donation flow → F2-01 (Receipt) → F2-02 (Recurring) — payments
5. **Phase 5**: F2-05 (AI Report) → F2-09 (Dashboard) — analytics
6. **Phase 6**: Integration testing + polish + release
